#: plugins/system_update/templates/system_update_help.html:10
msgid ""
"Before changing OSPy files, the plug-in starts an external watchdog. The updated process "
"confirms a healthy start after the scheduler responds and the web interface is listening. If "
"confirmation is not received within two minutes, the previous commit is restored and OSPy is "
"restarted automatically."
msgstr ""

